          "At HR Coordinators, the background check invoice reconciliation intake form should name the requester, the person or account reference, and the item that must be decided. It should also show the vendor invoice and the date the document was received. A stable case reference prevents the same request from being opened twice under different names. The queue owner can then compare new arrivals with work already in progress."
