          "Record the observation time separately from the entry time for background check invoice reconciliation. A value copied from the completed result record on Friday may describe a record that changed on Monday. HR Coordinators keeps both times so the HR operations lead can judge whether the evidence was current. Freshness matters more than the number of attachments in the file."
