          "Test one closed background check invoice reconciliation case each week by rebuilding it from the evidence map. The reviewer should find the authorized screening log, the decision to approve, dispute, or hold the invoice line, and the confirmation without opening a private thread. If the rebuild fails, reopen the case or repair the template that allowed the gap. HR Coordinators records the result beside invoice lines matched to an authorized screening so the check is not a one-time exercise."
