          "HR Coordinators writes the evidence rule on the worker classification change form instead of leaving it in a training deck. The form asks for the classification determination, the payroll setup record, and the field in the source system that will confirm the file change note. A reviewer can then reject an incomplete packet without a long explanation. The rule stays consistent when a new coordinator joins the queue."
