          "When a worker can be paid under the wrong tax and benefit treatment, the case should not close on the strength of a verbal assurance. HR Coordinators records the condition, the source that shows it, and the HR compliance owner who released the next step. The HR coordinator keeps the classification determination and the payroll setup record in the file so the decision can be reviewed later. The dependent action resumes only after the release is written down."
