          "If worker classification change hands work to another team, keep the case open until that team acknowledges receipt. HR Coordinators records the acknowledgment, the receiving owner, and the new review date. The HR coordinator links the handoff to the original request and the classification determination. A case that disappears at a team boundary has not been closed."
